OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed housemate to death
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for murder after
OL,7,Ffatally stabbing his housemate four
OL,8,Ftimes in the back before leaving to buy
OL,9,Falcohol.
OL,11,FMark Carpenter, 58, of Embankment Road,
OL,12,FPlymouth, murdered father-of-three
OL,13,FHarry Jackson in a Plymouth house share
OL,14,Fon 4 May.
OL,16,FJudge Robert Linford sentenced
OL,17,FCarpenter to a minimum of 17 years and
OL,18,Fsix months in jail after he was found
OL,19,Fguilty by a jury at Plymouth Crown
OL,20,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
